 later moving to a second site. ELIGIBILITY: any artist working in three di
 mensions. OFFER: GBP 20\,000 commission with fabrication support and mento
 ring from engineers and consultants\; up to five shortlisted artists get G
 BP 1\,000 each to make maquettes.\n\nOrganisation: Royal Society of Sculpt
 ors\nLocation: London (Dora House)\, then a second site.\nAward: GBP 20\,0
 00 commission for the winner\; up to 5 shortlisted artists receive GBP 1\,
 000 each for maquettes. Entry fee about GBP 34 (GBP 17 early bird until 17
  November).\nDuration: Fabrication and display through 2027\n\nMore: https
 ://sculptors.org.uk/awards/first-plinth-public-art-award?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
