 Machine (LCB Depot x New Media Art Club\, Leicester)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 04 Dec 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nCOMPUTALA is LCB Depot's an
 nual January season on technology in contemporary art practice\, made this
  year with New Media Art Club. The 2027 exhibition\, Superstition and the 
 Machine\, invites artists\, technologists and creative practitioners to ex
 plore the intersections of technology\, magic\, ritual and digital folklor
 e\, from any perspective.\n\nOrganisation: LCB Depot with New Media Art Cl
 ub\nLocation: Leicester\, UK (LCB Depot). Open to UK and international app
 licants\; international work can only be shown digitally.\nAward: GBP 50 p
 articipation fee for each selected artist (funded by Arts Council England 
 Project Grants). Free to enter. Work can be sold\; the retail partner take
 s a 20 percent admin fee on sales.\nDuration: Exhibition 11 to 30 January 
 2027 (launch 8 January)\n\nMore: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQL
 Sd1B0w4TuOQ42R9W3cZSTPtH2ZdMQRL3if7w8qw_tTTrpkvXg/viewform?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
